{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_186_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_186","textTraditional":"一、六年。春王正月，〈木巳〉伯益姑卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_186_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_186","textTraditional":"二、葬秦景公。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_186_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_186","textTraditional":"三、夏，季孫宿如晉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_186_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_186","textTraditional":"四、葬〈木巳〉文公。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_186_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_186","textTraditional":"五、宋華合比出奔衞。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_186_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_186","textTraditional":"六、秋九月，大雩。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_186_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_186","textTraditional":"七、楚薳頗帥師伐吳。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_186_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_186","textTraditional":"八、冬，叔弓如楚。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_186_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_186","textTraditional":"九、齊侯伐北燕。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}